### Register a new Student
POST https://localhost:7182/api/AuthControllerAC1/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hasan Test",
  "email": "hasan.test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@1234",
  "role": 0
}

### Register a Recruiter
POST https://localhost:7182/api/AuthControllerAC1/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Recruiter Test",
  "email": "recruiter.test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@1234",
  "role": 1
}